46
00:03:16,358 --> 00:03:16,878
[SPEAKER_00]: The Huggins.

47
00:03:17,579 --> 00:03:19,940
[SPEAKER_00]: And I said, what's the matter, Carl?

48
00:03:20,040 --> 00:03:20,560
[SPEAKER_00]: And he said,

49
00:03:24,572 --> 00:03:28,295
[SPEAKER_00]: Well, he says, you see, Frederica is having the...

