58
00:03:47,290 --> 00:03:48,971
[SPEAKER_00]: They can't get the baby in or out.

59
00:03:49,472 --> 00:03:52,775
[SPEAKER_00]: And he said, I asked Hug of...

60
00:03:53,601 --> 00:03:55,842
