[SPEAKER_01]: Mean he said, the title of his piece was The New Minor League, The National.

1356
01:54:10,034 --> 01:54:19,200
[SPEAKER_01]: And that implied that I, then in the St. Louis Post or whatever, Dispatch or whatever it was, he said that I said that they called the National League a Minor League, see?

1357
01:54:19,901 --> 01:54:28,587
[SPEAKER_01]: And, uh, uh, that was not, that was uh, that was uh,

1358
01:54:32,214 --> 01:54:33,635
[SPEAKER_00]: Oh, that left me bitter.

1359
01:54:34,216 --> 01:54:35,537
[SPEAKER_00]: That left me bitter.

1360
01:54:36,458 --> 01:54:39,460
[SPEAKER_00]: And by the way, I see it in one item here quickly.

1361
01:54:39,840 --> 01:54:41,782
