[SPEAKER_01]: It was crazy.

1368
01:54:59,689 --> 01:55:03,934
[SPEAKER_01]: There was only one ball player, in my estimation, that was the greatest of them all, and it was Rue.

1369
01:55:04,835 --> 01:55:06,717
[SPEAKER_01]: And I don't hold with it.

1370
01:55:06,797 --> 01:55:09,120
