1392
01:56:19,106 --> 01:56:20,726
[SPEAKER_01]: He was one heck of a ball player.

1393
01:56:21,326 --> 01:56:29,829
[SPEAKER_01]: But it came one Sunday, it's an interesting story, it came one Sunday down there, I think it was a Sunday, and it was raining.

1394
01:56:31,146 --> 01:56:39,753
[SPEAKER_01]: his best pitcher pitching, I forget who it was, but the uh... it was and uh... the umpires wouldn't call the game and uh...

1395
01:56:39,953 --> 01:56:56,907
